  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support USAID Priorities-Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will support ongoing protection and monitoring of Mkomazi National Park&apos;s fenced rhino sanctuary. Funds will be used to support security and rhino monitoring salaries and expenses, aerial surveillance in the area, specialized training for park personnel, and maintenance of essential infrastructure for the rhino sanctuary including fencing, boreholes for water supply and security outposts.</narrative>
  </description>
